{
  "id": "MRK.3",
  "number": "3",
  "bookId": "MRK",
  "reference": "Mark 3",
  "copyright": "The Holy Bible, New International Version® NIV® Copyright © 1973, 1978, 1984, 2011 by Biblica, Inc.® Used by Permission of Biblica, Inc.® All rights reserved worldwide.",
  "verseCount": 35,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "3",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "MRK 3"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "3",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Jesus Heals on the Sabbath",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Another time Jesus went into the synagogue, and a man with a shriveled hand was there.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Some of them were looking for a reason to accuse Jesus, so they watched him closely to see if he would heal him on the Sabbath.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jesus said to the man with the shriveled hand,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\"Stand up in front of everyone.\"",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MRK.3.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MRK.3.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then Jesus asked them,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\"Which is lawful on the Sabbath: to do good or to do evil, to save life or to kill?\"",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MRK.3.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MRK.3.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But they remained silent.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.3.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He looked around at them in anger and, deeply distressed at their stubborn hearts, said to the man,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\"Stretch out your hand.\"",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MRK.3.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MRK.3.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He stretched it out, and his hand was completely restored.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then the Pharisees went out and began to plot with the Herodians how they might kill Jesus.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.3.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Crowds Follow Jesus",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jesus withdrew with his disciples to the lake, and a large crowd from Galilee followed.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When they heard about all he was doing, many people came to him from Judea, Jerusalem, Idumea, and the regions across the Jordan and around Tyre and Sidon.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Because of the crowd he told his disciples to have a small boat ready for him, to keep the people from crowding him.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For he had healed many, so that those with diseases were pushing forward to touch him.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Whenever the impure spirits saw him, they fell down before him and cried out, \"You are the Son of God.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But he gave them strict orders not to tell others about him.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.3.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Jesus Appoints the Twelve",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jesus went up on a mountainside and called to him those he wanted, and they came to him.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He appointed twelve",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "that they might be with him and that he might send them out to preach",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and to have authority to drive out demons.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.3.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "lh"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "These are the twelve he appointed:",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b",
        "vid": "MRK 3:16"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1",
        "vid": "MRK 3:16"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Simon (to whom he gave the name Peter),",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.3.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "James son of Zebedee and his brother John (to them he gave the name Boanerges, which means \"sons of thunder\"),",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.3.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 3:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Andrew,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.3.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1",
        "vid": "MRK 3:18"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Philip,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.3.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1",
        "vid": "MRK 3:18"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Bartholomew,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.3.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1",
        "vid": "MRK 3:18"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Matthew,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.3.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1",
        "vid": "MRK 3:18"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Thomas,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.3.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1",
        "vid": "MRK 3:18"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "James son of Alphaeus,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.3.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1",
        "vid": "MRK 3:18"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Thaddaeus,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.3.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1",
        "vid": "MRK 3:18"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Simon the Zealot",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.3.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 3:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and Judas Iscariot, who betrayed him.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.3.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.3.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Jesus Accused by His Family and by Teachers of the Law",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 3:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then Jesus entered a house, and again a crowd gathered, so that he and his disciples were not even able to eat.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.3.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.3.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 3:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When his family",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.3.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.3.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "heard about this, they went to take charge of him, for they said, \"He is out of his mind.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.3.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.3.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 3:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the teachers of the law who came down from Jerusalem said, \"He is possessed by Beelzebul! By the prince of demons he is driving out demons.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.3.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.3.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 3:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So Jesus called them over to him and began to speak to them in parables:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.3.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.3.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\"How can Satan drive out Satan?",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MRK.3.23",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MRK.3.23"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.3.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.3.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 3:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "If a kingdom is divided against itself, that kingdom cannot stand.",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MRK.3.24",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MRK.3.24"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.3.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.3.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 3:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "If a house is divided against itself, that house cannot stand.",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MRK.3.25",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MRK.3.25"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.3.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.3.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 3:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "And if Satan opposes himself and is divided, he cannot stand; his end has come.",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MRK.3.26",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MRK.3.26"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.3.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.3.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 3:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "In fact, no one can enter a strong man's house without first tying him up. Then he can plunder the strong man's house.",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MRK.3.27",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MRK.3.27"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.3.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.3.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 3:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Truly I tell you, people can be forgiven all their sins and every slander they utter,",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MRK.3.28",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MRK.3.28"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.3.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.3.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 3:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "but whoever blasphemes against the Holy Spirit will never be forgiven; they are guilty of an eternal sin.\"",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MRK.3.29",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MRK.3.29"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 3:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He said this because they were saying, \"He has an impure spirit.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.3.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.3.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 3:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then Jesus' mother and brothers arrived. Standing outside, they sent someone in to call him.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.3.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.3.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 3:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A crowd was sitting around him, and they told him, \"Your mother and brothers are outside looking for you.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.3.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.3.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 3:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\"Who are my mother and my brothers?\"",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MRK.3.33",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MRK.3.33"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "he asked.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.3.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.3.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 3:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then he looked at those seated in a circle around him and said,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.3.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.3.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\"Here are my mother and my brothers!",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MRK.3.34",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MRK.3.34"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.3.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.3.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 3:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Whoever does God's will is my brother and sister and mother.\"",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MRK.3.35",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MRK.3.35"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
